1
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,880
Alright! Perfect!

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:13,260
- Thank you.
- Lighting check complete.

3
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,350
Front row!

4
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:16,140
Leave Takizawa's seat empty for now.

5
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,770
I-I'll go check!

6
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,890
Also, Rin!

7
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:21,100
The final line is...

8
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,480
What was the line
here again?

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,940
It was changed,
but what was it?

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,280
- I'll go check!
- What is it?

11
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,360
What's wrong?

12
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:30,410
My Lord.

13
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:31,990
Please calm down.

14
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:36,750
In the end, the Duke proposes to me.

15
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,250
The audience is all here

16
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,290
to wish us well.

17
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:43,080
Just think of it that way.

18
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,630
You've changed.

19
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:48,880
It's all thanks to you, senpai.

20
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,430
A Duke getting a pep talk from his vassal...

21
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:53,760
How unseemly.

22
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,260
Alright!

23
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:58,560
Everyone, gather round!

24
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:04,360
Let's give them the best show ever!

25
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:06,320
Yeah!!
